f2.jpg"}], "slug": "cat-secretary", "storyline": "Try to imagine one company owning all of the most important intellectual properties in the world. A juggernaut studio with its own publishing company, recording studio, and theme parks. A corporation that is slowly replacing human storytelling with profit-motivated, AI-assisted soulless content creation. It sounds impossible, but this is increasingly the state of DOX, Inc.\n\nAs your Cat starts on the ground floor, they scratch the not-so-fluffy underbelly of DOX to see what secrets it holds. With the help of an eccentric Chief Creative Officer and the staff of MouseCorp, (a smaller company that works within the walls of DOX), Cat Secretary works their way to the top uncovering old histories and untold mysteries.", "summary": "Keep your job by day. At night, sneak around the office and solve your colleagues' problems. Who's a good Cat Secretary? You are!", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cat-secretary", "videos": [{"id": 161861, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "oaZLe_Vhqe0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaZLe_Vhqe0", "title": "Cat Secretary - September 2025 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oaZLe_Vhqe0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 169779, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "67jSEnQ5AYo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=67jSEnQ5AYo", "title": "Cat Secretary Trailer - November 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/67jSEnQ5AYo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 181667, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "oc4v78TvZjI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oc4v78TvZjI", "title": "Cat Secretary Trailer - March 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oc4v78TvZjI/fhddefault.jpg"}]}